stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Proposed: a figure is computed from register rows
    Proposed --> Refused: the basis, the units or the denominators do not match
    Proposed --> Current: DV1 inputs name rows, components, values and basis
    Refused --> [*]: the refusal is recorded with its reason and never re-derived silently
    Current --> Stale: DV2 a new capture of any input lands
    Stale --> Current: DV3 re-evaluated and reproduced under its stated rounding
    Current --> Current: DV5 an input qualifier changes and the output qualifiers recompute
    Stale --> Broken: DV4 an input is killed
    Current --> Broken: DV4 an input is killed
    Broken --> [*]: the output is withdrawn from every surface and framed as dead

    note right of Current
        The grade is computed, never typed.
        It is the weakest input's grade
        with every input qualifier carried.
    end note

    note right of Stale
        Release uses block while stale.
        An archived input never goes stale
        because its source is frozen.
    end note
